{"id":"H0869","lemma":"אֶתְנַן","transliteration":"etnan","sayIt":"et-nan","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Ethnan","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1Ch.4.7;\nson of: Ashhur (H0806) and Helah (H2458);\nbrother of: Haahashtari (H0326), Zereth (H6889), Izhar (H3328) and Koz (H6976);\nhalf-brother of: Ahuzzam (H0275), Hepher (H2660) and Temeni (H8488)\n§ Ethnan = \"hire of unchastity\"\na grandson of Ashur","glosses":["ethnan"],"count":1,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"1ch-4","v":7,"renderings":{"bsb":"Ethnan","kjv":"and Ethnan"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"1 Chronicles 4:7","note":"The sons of Helah were Zereth, Izhar, and Ethnan.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H0275","lemma":"אֲחֻזָּם","transliteration":"achuzzam","gloss":"Ahuzzam"},{"id":"H0326","lemma":"אֲחַשְׁתָּרִי","transliteration":"achashtari","gloss":"Haahashtari"},{"id":"H0806","lemma":"אַשְׁחוּר","transliteration":"ashchur","gloss":"Ashhur"},{"id":"H2458","lemma":"חֶלְאָה","transliteration":"chelah","gloss":"Helah"},{"id":"H6889","lemma":"צֶ֫רֶת","transliteration":"tseret","gloss":"Zereth"},{"id":"H3328","lemma":"יִצְחַר","transliteration":"yitschar","gloss":"Izhar"},{"id":"H6976","lemma":"קוֹץ","transliteration":"qots","gloss":"Koz"},{"id":"H2660","lemma":"חֵ֫פֶר","transliteration":"chepher","gloss":"Hepher"}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}